    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a horror puzzle game in which a man goes to the village where his parents lived.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playtime is 15-30 minutes and there are two endings.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore the village</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can't contact your parents. Go to the village where your parents live and find out what happened in the town.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Long ago, from the point when you left the town, the village started to have an evil aura. Now the village is quiet as if no one lives there. Find the people who disappeared and the memories you forgot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3272990/extras/1f7ba0339dd2775be0b5d3e08587f82d.avif?t=1734664553\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choose your path</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Villagers have been holding rituals since ancient times. But their rituals were not common. You will be confronted with the lives that were sacrificed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you join your parents in believing in the pseudo-religion? Or will you take the side of the lives that were sacrificed?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3272990/extras/d4dd6a7f3279ca3bde1695968223643b.avif?t=1734664553\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Follow the trail</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Religious items used by your parents remain in the house. There are also hidden traces of someone other than your parents. You must interpret the messages left by that person and follow the path she leads you. Check every\u00a0nook and cranny of the house to make sure there is no evidence you have missed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3272990/extras/c027aa74c77741142c24595884661442.avif?t=1734664553\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
