"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3272990/extras/c027aa74c77741142c24595884661442.avif?t=1734664553\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
